<view class="screen {{theme}}"><mm-header back="{{true}}" bindback="back"/><view class="content"><mm-state busy="{{busy}}" error="{{error}}" bindretry="retry"/><view class="eyebrow">COMPARE / 两份可核对的观察</view><view class="title">具体差在哪里？</view><block wx:if="{{result}}"><view wx:if="{{!result.comparable}}" class="card"><mm-chart kind="empty"/><view class="heading">这两份报告口径不同</view><view>算法版本或选择规则不同，不能直接相减。</view><button class="link" bindtap="go" data-tab="true" data-url="/pages/history/index">重新选择报告</button></view><block wx:else><view class="note">同版本、同选择规则。分布距离不代表心理变化，也不是审美高低。</view><view class="card"><view class="heading">变化事实</view><view wx:for="{{facts}}" wx:key="index" class="rule"><view class="fact-label">{{item.label}}</view><view>{{item.value}}</view></view></view><view class="card"><view class="heading">艺人份额变化</view><view wx:for="{{artistChanges}}" wx:key="id" class="rule"><view>艺人 {{item.id}}</view><view>{{item.beforeText}} → {{item.afterText}}</view><view class="caption">{{item.deltaText}}</view></view></view></block><button class="secondary" bindtap="go" data-url="/pages/evidence/index?snapshotId={{from}}">查看较早的报告</button><view class="spacer"></view><button class="secondary" bindtap="go" data-url="/pages/evidence/index?snapshotId={{to}}">查看较新的报告</button></block></view></view>
